    "id": "cell-3"
   },
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Area 1 — Unified LLM Gateway (OpenAI-Compatible Chat Completions)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Applications send standard OpenAI `/v1/chat/completions` requests while **Apigee** translates wire formats, injects Google Cloud credentials via `<GoogleAccessToken>`, and routes traffic to **Vertex AI Gemini**, partner models, or **`smart-router`**—eliminating application lock-in.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 1.1 — Deploy the Base LLM Gateway Proxy via AFT\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Deploys `templates/llm-gateway-completions-no-auth.yaml` to your Apigee environment using `aft`, showing live deployment progress until the proxy revision reaches `READY`.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Establishes the foundational `/v1/chat/completions` gateway endpoint.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Click **Run (▶)** on cell **1.1** below.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** deployment card confirming `llm-gateway-completions-no-auth` is live.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 1.2 — Test Unified LLM Gateway, Live SSE Streaming & Smart Router\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Sends a live OpenAI-formatted chat completion call through Apigee—streaming chunks live in real time when `STREAM = True`—and renders the decoded UTF-8 response, Time-to-First-Token (`TTFT`), resolved backend model, and token metrics.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Verifies end-to-end routing, UTF-8 encoding (`€ £ ¥ 🚀`), real-time Server-Sent Events (`STREAM = True`), and dynamic model selection with `MODEL = \"smart-router\"` on complex multi-step architecture prompts.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Select a `MODEL` (such as `\"gemini-flash-latest\"` or `\"smart-router\"`), pick a standard or `[Smart-Router Complex Prompt]` from `PROMPT`, toggle `STREAM = True` to watch tokens stream live from the backend, and click **Run (▶)**.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** Live streaming progress followed by a green **✅ PASS** Web Client card displaying the model route, SSE chunk count, latency, and token usage."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-4"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 1.1 Deploy LLM Gateway Proxy via AFT\n",
    "deploy_gateway_step(\n",
    "    step_title=\"Step 1.1 — Base LLM Gateway Proxy Deployed\",\n",
    "    template_yaml=\"templates/llm-gateway-completions-no-auth.yaml\",\n",
    "    proxy_name=\"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth\",\n",
    ")"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-5"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 1.2 Test LLM Gateway Deployment\n",
    "MODEL = \"gemini-flash-latest\"  #@param [\"google/gemini-3.8-flash\", \"google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\", \"google/gemini-3.7-flash\", \"google/gemini-flash-latest\", \"google/gemini-2.5-flash\", \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\", \"smart-router\"] {allow-input: true}\n",
    "PROMPT = \"Explain in 3 concise bullet points how an AI Gateway governs Enterprise LLMs (include UTF-8 symbols: € £ ¥ 🚀).\"  #@param [\"Explain in 3 concise bullet points how an AI Gateway governs Enterprise LLMs (include UTF-8 symbols: € £ ¥ 🚀).\", \"[Smart-Router Complex Prompt] Act as a Principal Cloud Architect. Perform a multi-step architectural and FinOps trade-off analysis for deploying a global multi-region AI Gateway serving 50M monthly requests (avg 1,200 input / 400 output tokens) across regulated banking workloads in EU and US: (1) compare active-active vs regional failover topologies under a 400ms TTFT SLO, (2) model monthly token cost savings at 15%, 35%, and 55% semantic cache hit rates, and (3) recommend a defense-in-depth policy chain for prompt injection, PCI-DSS/GDPR PII redaction, and per-tenant token quotas.\", \"Why is the sky blue? Explain in two short sentences.\", \"Return a compact JSON object with 3 best practices for enterprise AI governance.\"] {allow-input: true}\n",
    "STREAM = False  #@param {type:\"boolean\"}\n",
    "MAX_TOKENS = 2048  #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "result_1_2 = call_gateway_chat(PROMPT, MODEL, stream=STREAM, max_tokens=MAX_TOKENS, expected_proxy=\"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth\")\n",
    "render_test_client_card(\"Step 1.2 — Unified LLM Gateway Test Client\", \"OpenAI /v1/chat/completions routed via Apigee\", PROMPT, MODEL, result_1_2)"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
