    "id": "cell-6"
   },
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Area 2 — Prompt-Injection and Jailbreak Guardrails (Model Armor)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Protects enterprise AI applications against prompt-injection, jailbreak (\"DAN\"), phishing generation, and unsafe outputs by inspecting every incoming user prompt and outgoing model response with **Google Cloud Model Armor**.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 2.0 (Optional) — Create Model Armor Request & Response Templates\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Automatically creates (or updates if already present) two regional **Model Armor** templates in `REGION` from Step 0—one for `ModelArmorTemplateRequestName` and one for `ModelArmorTemplateResponseName`—pre-configured with Prompt Injection & Jailbreak detection, Malicious URL filtering, and Responsible AI safety filters.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary (when needed):** Run this optional cell if you do not already have Model Armor templates provisioned in `REGION`. When executed, **Step 2.1** automatically takes the newly created template names and continues without asking. Skip this step if you already have existing templates in `REGION` that you want to enter in Step 2.1.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Optionally customize `REQUEST_TEMPLATE_ID`, `RESPONSE_TEMPLATE_ID`, or `CONFIDENCE_LEVEL`, and click **Run (▶)** (or skip directly to Step 2.1).\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** card confirming both Model Armor templates are ready in `REGION` and registered for automatic handoff to Step 2.1.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 2.1 — Undeploy Base Proxy & Deploy Model Armor Guardrails Proxy\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Undeploys `llm-gateway-completions-no-auth`, resolves `ModelArmorTemplateRequestName` and `ModelArmorTemplateResponseName` in `REGION` (**automatically taking the newly created template names if Step 2.0 was executed, or asking you for the template names if Step 2.0 was skipped**), updates `features/ai-security-modelarmor.yaml`, deploys `templates/llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-model-armor.yaml`, and waits until `READY`.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Attaches automated bidirectional AI safety screening at the Apigee gateway edge.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Click **Run (▶)**. If you ran Step 2.0, deployment proceeds automatically; otherwise, provide your existing template names in the form fields or when prompted.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** deployment card confirming `llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-model-armor` is live.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 2.2 — Test Adversarial & Safe Prompts Against Model Armor\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Sends simulated jailbreak/phishing attacks or safe business questions to verify Model Armor enforcement.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Confirms unsafe prompts are intercepted at the gateway before consuming LLM tokens or exposing sensitive instructions.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Pick an attack or safe prompt from `PROMPT` and click **Run (▶)**.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A **🛡️ POLICY VERIFIED** card when malicious prompts are blocked (`HTTP 400`), or a **✅ PASS** card for safe prompts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-6b"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 2.0 (Optional) Create Model Armor Request & Response Templates\n",
    "REQUEST_TEMPLATE_ID = \"ai-gw-ma-template-input\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "RESPONSE_TEMPLATE_ID = \"ai-gw-ma-template-output\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "CONFIDENCE_LEVEL = \"MEDIUM_AND_ABOVE\"  #@param [\"MEDIUM_AND_ABOVE\", \"LOW_AND_ABOVE\", \"HIGH\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "target_ma_loc = REGION\n",
    "req_id_clean = REQUEST_TEMPLATE_ID.strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "resp_id_clean = RESPONSE_TEMPLATE_ID.strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "start_progress(\n",
    "    \"Step 2.0 (Optional) — Provisioning Model Armor Templates\",\n",
    "    f\"Step 1/2: Creating or updating request template '{req_id_clean}' in '{target_ma_loc}'...\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "req_action, req_resource = upsert_model_armor_template(req_id_clean, target_ma_loc, CONFIDENCE_LEVEL, \"Request\")\n",
    "\n",
    "update_progress(f\"Step 2/2: Creating or updating response template '{resp_id_clean}' in '{target_ma_loc}'...\")\n",
    "resp_action, resp_resource = upsert_model_armor_template(resp_id_clean, target_ma_loc, CONFIDENCE_LEVEL, \"Response\")\n",
    "\n",
    "GATEWAY_STATE[\"model_armor_templates\"] = {\n",
    "    \"created\": True,\n",
    "    \"request_name\": req_id_clean,\n",
    "    \"response_name\": resp_id_clean,\n",
    "    \"location\": target_ma_loc,\n",
    "}\n",
    "GATEWAY_STATE[\"policy_params\"][\"ModelArmorTemplateRequestName\"] = req_id_clean\n",
    "GATEWAY_STATE[\"policy_params\"][\"ModelArmorTemplateResponseName\"] = resp_id_clean\n",
    "\n",
    "show_status_card(\n",
    "    \"PASS\",\n",
    "    \"Step 2.0 Complete — Model Armor Templates Ready for Step 2.1\",\n",
    "    \"Step 2.1 will automatically use these newly created template names without prompting.\",\n",
    "    rows=[\n",
    "        (\"ModelArmorTemplateRequestName\", f\"{req_id_clean} ({req_action})\"),\n",
    "        (\"Request Template Resource\", req_resource),\n",
    "        (\"ModelArmorTemplateResponseName\", f\"{resp_id_clean} ({resp_action})\"),\n",
    "        (\"Response Template Resource\", resp_resource),\n",
    "        (\"Model Armor Region (Step 0 REGION)\", f\"{target_ma_loc} (modelarmor.{target_ma_loc}.rep.googleapis.com)\"),\n",
    "        (\"Configured Safety Filters\", f\"Prompt Injection & Jailbreak, Malicious URL, Responsible AI ({CONFIDENCE_LEVEL})\"),\n",
    "        (\"Step 2.1 Handoff Status\", \"Auto-configured — click Run (▶) on Step 2.1 to deploy\"),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    ")"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-7"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 2.1 Undeploy Previous Proxy & Deploy Model Armor Proxy via AFT\n",
    "ModelArmorTemplateRequestName = \"\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "ModelArmorTemplateResponseName = \"\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "ma_created_state = GATEWAY_STATE.get(\"model_armor_templates\", {})\n",
    "if ma_created_state.get(\"created\"):\n",
    "    resolved_req_tpl = str(ma_created_state[\"request_name\"]).strip()\n",
    "    resolved_resp_tpl = str(ma_created_state[\"response_name\"]).strip()\n",
    "    resolved_ma_loc = str(ma_created_state.get(\"location\") or REGION).strip()\n",
    "    tpl_source_note = f\"Auto-loaded from Step 2.0 ({resolved_req_tpl}, {resolved_resp_tpl} @ {resolved_ma_loc})\"\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    resolved_req_tpl = ModelArmorTemplateRequestName.strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "    resolved_resp_tpl = ModelArmorTemplateResponseName.strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "    if not resolved_req_tpl or not resolved_resp_tpl:\n",
    "        print(\"ℹ️ Optional Step 2.0 was not executed. Please enter your existing Model Armor template names:\")\n",
    "    if not resolved_req_tpl:\n",
    "        resolved_req_tpl = input(\"Enter ModelArmorTemplateRequestName (request template ID): \").strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "    if not resolved_resp_tpl:\n",
    "        resolved_resp_tpl = input(\"Enter ModelArmorTemplateResponseName (response template ID): \").strip().split(\"/\")[-1].strip()\n",
    "    if not resolved_req_tpl or not resolved_resp_tpl:\n",
    "        fail_step(\n",
    "            \"Step 2.1 — Model Armor Template Names Required\",\n",
    "            \"Optional Step 2.0 was not executed and one or both template names were left blank.\",\n",
    "            \"Either run Step 2.0 (Optional) above to create the Model Armor templates automatically, \"\n",
    "            \"or re-run Step 2.1 and provide both ModelArmorTemplateRequestName and ModelArmorTemplateResponseName.\",\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    resolved_ma_loc = REGION\n",
    "    tpl_source_note = f\"User-provided templates ({resolved_req_tpl}, {resolved_resp_tpl} @ {resolved_ma_loc})\"\n",
    "\n",
    "req_tpl_expr = f'\"projects/{{GoogleCloudProject}}/locations/{resolved_ma_loc}/templates/{resolved_req_tpl}\"'\n",
    "resp_tpl_expr = f'\"projects/{{GoogleCloudProject}}/locations/{resolved_ma_loc}/templates/{resolved_resp_tpl}\"'\n",
    "ma_feature_updates = {\n",
    "    \"ModelArmorTemplateRequestName\": resolved_req_tpl,\n",
    "    \"ModelArmorTemplateResponseName\": resolved_resp_tpl,\n",
    "    \"ModelArmorTemplateRequest\": req_tpl_expr,\n",
    "    \"ModelArmorTemplateResponse\": resp_tpl_expr,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "deploy_gateway_step(\n",
    "    step_title=\"Step 2.1 — Model Armor Guardrails Proxy Deployed\",\n",
    "    template_yaml=\"templates/llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-model-armor.yaml\",\n",
    "    proxy_name=\"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-model-armor\",\n",
    "    undeploy_previous=\"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth\",\n",
    "    feature_patches={\"features/ai-security-modelarmor.yaml\": ma_feature_updates},\n",
    "    extra_rows=[(\"Model Armor Template Source\", tpl_source_note)],\n",
    ")"
   ],
