    "---\n",
    "## Area 4 — Authentication, Model Allow-Listing & Token Quota Governance\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Gives platform teams granular control over **who** can invoke the AI Gateway (`x-api-key`), **which models** each product tier is authorized to use, and **how many tokens per minute or hour** each consumer can spend—stopping unauthorized access and runaway LLM bills.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 4.1 — Deploy Authenticated Proxy, API Products & Developer Apps\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Undeploys `llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-ma-sdp`, deploys `templates/llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp.yaml`, and provisions `config/products/ai-premium-package.yaml` and `config/apps/user_apps.yaml` via `aft`.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Enables API key verification (`VA-VerifyKey`), per-product model allow-listing (`JS-ValidateRequest`), and LLM token quota governance (`LTQ-QuotaEnforce` / `LTQ-QuotaCount`) on `/v1/chat/completions`.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Click **Run (▶)** on cell **4.1** below.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** card showing the deployed proxy, products, apps, and active Consumer API Key (`premium-app-key-123`).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 4.2 — Test API Keys, Model Allow-List, Quota-Aware LLM Responses & Auto-Burst Enforcement\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Dynamically looks up the **API Product and per-model LLM Token Quotas** configured in Apigee for the given `API_KEY`, runs realistic enterprise FinOps and capacity-planning workloads (`~450`, `~4,000`, `~6,500`, or `~11,000` tokens) or a single-click **Auto-Burst Quota Test (`200 OK` → `HTTP 429`)**, and includes the resolved API Product quotas **both inside the LLM's own generated response** and in a dedicated **🔑 API Product & Token Quota Policy** table on the Web Client card.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Validates `401 Unauthorized` (missing/invalid key), `403 Model not allowed` (disallowed model such as `google/gemini-3.7-flash` or `gemini-flash-latest`), quota-aware `200 OK` responses on authorized models (`google/gemini-3.8-flash` @ `10,000 tokens/min`, `anthropic/claude-opus-5` @ `10,000 tokens/hr`, `google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite` unlimited), and live `429 Quota exhausted` throttling when token usage exceeds the product budget.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Choose an `API_KEY`, `MODEL`, and realistic FinOps `PROMPT` (or select `[Auto-Burst Quota Test: 200 OK -> HTTP 429]` to trigger both a quota-aware `200 OK` LLM response and `HTTP 429` throttling in one click) and click **Run (▶)**.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A visual **✅ PASS** or **🛡️ POLICY VERIFIED** card displaying the active key's API Product quota schedule, `%` of token budget consumed, and the LLM's response including the API Product quotas defined for your key."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
