   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Area 5 — Semantic Caching (Faster Responses & Zero Token Cost on Cache Hits)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Uses Vertex AI Embeddings and Vector Search at the Apigee edge (`SemanticCacheLookup` / `SemanticCachePopulate`) to recognize when a new prompt has the same meaning as a recent question—returning the cached response immediately (`cached-content: true`) with **sub-second latency and zero upstream LLM cost**.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 5.1 — Undeploy Previous Proxy & Deploy Semantic Caching Proxy + Product\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Undeploys `llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp`, deploys `templates/llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic.yaml`, and updates `config/products/ai-premium-package.yaml` so your API key is authorized for the new semantic caching proxy.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Activates semantic similarity caching while preserving Authentication, Model Armor, SDP, and Token Quotas.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Click **Run (▶)** on cell **5.1** below.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** deployment card confirming `llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic` and `ai-premium-package` are live.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 5.2 — Side-by-Side Semantic Caching Comparison Test\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Executes a two-call comparison (**Call #1** seeds the cache, **Call #2** sends an identical or semantically rephrased question) and highlights latency speedup, `cached-content` header status, and response consistency side by side.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Demonstrates real-world latency reduction and cost avoidance for recurring user questions.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Choose a `SEMANTIC_TEST_PAIR` (or enter custom prompts) and click **Run (▶)**.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A highlighted **Side-by-Side Semantic Cache Comparison Card** comparing Call #1 vs. Call #2."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-16"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 5.1 Undeploy Previous Proxy & Deploy Semantic Caching Proxy and Product via AFT\n",
    "deploy_gateway_step(\n",
    "    step_title=\"Step 5.1 — Semantic Caching Proxy & API Product Deployed\",\n",
    "    template_yaml=\"templates/llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic.yaml\",\n",
    "    proxy_name=\"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic\",\n",
    "    undeploy_previous=\"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp\",\n",
    "    product_yamls=[\"config/products/ai-premium-package.yaml\"],\n",
    ")"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-17"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 5.2 Test Semantic Caching Deployment (Side-by-Side Highlighted Comparison)\n",
    "API_KEY = \"premium-app-key-123\"  #@param [\"premium-app-key-123\", \"invalid-api-key-999\", \"\"] {allow-input: true}\n",
    "MODEL = \"google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"  #@param [\"google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\", \"google/gemini-3.8-flash\", \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\", \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5\", \"google/gemini-3.7-flash\", \"google/gemini-flash-latest\", \"gemini-flash-latest\", \"google/gemini-2.5-flash\", \"smart-router\"] {allow-input: true}\n",
    "SEMANTIC_TEST_PAIR = \"Pair 1 (Semantic Rephrase): 'Why is the sky blue? Please explain in two short sentences.' vs 'Can you explain in two short sentences why the sky is blue?'\"  #@param [\"Pair 1 (Semantic Rephrase): 'Why is the sky blue? Please explain in two short sentences.' vs 'Can you explain in two short sentences why the sky is blue?'\", \"Pair 2 (Benefits Paraphrase): 'Summarize the main benefits of an API gateway in three bullet points.' vs 'Summarize the key benefits of an API gateway in three bullet points.'\", \"Pair 3 (Exact Match): 'What is the capital of France and what is it famous for?' vs 'What is the capital of France and what is it famous for?'\", \"Control (Different Topic — Cache Miss): 'Why is the sky blue? Explain in two short sentences.' vs 'What causes ocean tides on Earth? Explain in two short sentences.'\"]\n",
    "CUSTOM_PROMPT_1 = \"\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "CUSTOM_PROMPT_2 = \"\"  #@param {type:\"string\"}\n",
    "PAUSE_SECONDS_BETWEEN_CALLS = 2  #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
    "STREAM = False  #@param {type:\"boolean\"}\n",
    "MAX_TOKENS = 512  #@param {type:\"integer\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "SEMANTIC_PAIRS = {\n",
    "    \"Pair 1\": (\"Why is the sky blue? Please explain in two short sentences.\", \"Can you explain in two short sentences why the sky is blue?\"),\n",
    "    \"Pair 2\": (\"Summarize the main benefits of an API gateway in three bullet points.\", \"Summarize the key benefits of an API gateway in three bullet points.\"),\n",
    "    \"Pair 3\": (\"What is the capital of France and what is it famous for?\", \"What is the capital of France and what is it famous for?\"),\n",
    "    \"Control\": (\"Why is the sky blue? Explain in two short sentences.\", \"What causes ocean tides on Earth? Explain in two short sentences.\"),\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "pair_key = SEMANTIC_TEST_PAIR.split(\" (\")[0].strip()\n",
    "def_p1, def_p2 = SEMANTIC_PAIRS.get(pair_key, SEMANTIC_PAIRS[\"Pair 1\"])\n",
    "prompt_1, prompt_2 = CUSTOM_PROMPT_1.strip() or def_p1, CUSTOM_PROMPT_2.strip() or def_p2\n",
    "active_key = API_KEY.strip() or GATEWAY_STATE.get(\"api_key\", \"premium-app-key-123\")\n",
    "pause_sec = max(1, int(PAUSE_SECONDS_BETWEEN_CALLS))\n",
    "\n",
    "start_progress(\"Step 5.2 — Semantic Caching Comparison\", \"Step 1/3: Sending Call #1 (seeding Semantic Cache)...\")\n",
    "call_1 = call_gateway_chat(\n",
    "    prompt_1, MODEL, stream=STREAM, max_tokens=MAX_TOKENS, api_key=active_key,\n",
    "    expected_proxy=\"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic\", manage_progress=False, progress_prefix=\"Step 1/3 — Call #1 (Cache Seed)\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "if not call_1[\"ok\"]:\n",
    "    render_test_client_card(\"Step 5.2 — Call #1 Blocked / Failed\", \"Call #1 (Cache Seed)\", prompt_1, MODEL, call_1, expect_block=(call_1[\"status_code\"] in (400, 401, 403, 429)))\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    update_progress(f\"Step 2/3: Call #1 completed in {call_1['elapsed_ms']} ms — pausing {pause_sec}s for Semantic Cache indexing...\")\n",
    "    time.sleep(pause_sec)\n",
    "    update_progress(\"Step 3/3: Sending Call #2 (testing Semantic Cache lookup)...\")\n",
    "    call_2 = call_gateway_chat(\n",
    "        prompt_2, MODEL, stream=STREAM, max_tokens=MAX_TOKENS, api_key=active_key,\n",
    "        expected_proxy=\"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic\", manage_progress=False, progress_prefix=\"Step 3/3 — Call #2 (Cache Lookup)\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    if not call_2[\"ok\"]:\n",
    "        render_test_client_card(\"Step 5.2 — Call #2 Blocked / Failed\", \"Call #2 (Cache Lookup)\", prompt_2, MODEL, call_2, expect_block=(call_2[\"status_code\"] in (400, 401, 403, 429)))\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        ms_1, ms_2 = call_1[\"elapsed_ms\"], call_2[\"elapsed_ms\"]\n",
    "        speedup_pct = round(((ms_1 - ms_2) / ms_1) * 100.0, 1) if ms_1 > 0 else 0.0\n",
    "        exact_match = bool(call_2[\"reply\"].strip()) and call_1[\"reply\"].strip() == call_2[\"reply\"].strip()\n",
    "        is_hit = call_2[\"cache_hit\"] or (exact_match and pair_key != \"Control\")\n",
    "        badge_cls = \"agw-cache\" if is_hit else \"agw-pass\"\n",
    "        badge_text = \"⚡ SEMANTIC CACHE HIT (cached-content: true)\" if call_2[\"cache_hit\"] else (\"⚡ SEMANTIC CACHE HIT (Identical Output)\" if is_hit else \"🔄 SEMANTIC CACHE MISS (Fresh LLM Call)\")\n",
    "        pair_label = safe_text(SEMANTIC_TEST_PAIR.split(\":\")[0])\n",
    "        model_lbl = safe_text(_format_model_route(MODEL, call_2[\"resolved_model\"]))\n",
    "        cache_hdr_txt = safe_text(call_2[\"cache_header\"] or \"false\")\n",
    "        match_txt = \"✅ Yes (100%)\" if exact_match else \"ℹ️ Distinct Text\"\n",
    "        box2_cls = \"agw-box-reply\" if is_hit else \"agw-box-prompt\"\n",
    "        call2_mode = \"Served from Semantic Cache\" if is_hit else \"Fresh LLM Generation\"\n",
    "        reply_1_safe, reply_2_safe = safe_text(call_1[\"reply\"]), safe_text(call_2[\"reply\"])\n",
    "        render_utf8_html(\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-card\"><div class=\"agw-header\"><div><div class=\"agw-title\">Step 5.2 — Semantic Caching Side-by-Side Comparison</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-subtitle\">{pair_label} | Model: {model_lbl}</div></div>'\n",
    "            f'<span class=\"agw-badge {badge_cls}\">{badge_text}</span></div><div class=\"agw-body\"><div class=\"agw-pills\">'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-pill\"><strong>Call #1 Latency:</strong> {ms_1} ms</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-pill\"><strong>Call #2 Latency:</strong> {ms_2} ms</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-pill\"><strong>Latency Reduction:</strong> {speedup_pct:+.1f}%</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-pill\"><strong>cached-content Header:</strong> {cache_hdr_txt}</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-pill\"><strong>Exact Output Match:</strong> {match_txt}</div></div>'\n",
    "            f'<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:14px;\">'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-box agw-box-prompt\"><strong>1️⃣ Call #1 (Seeds Cache — {ms_1} ms)</strong><br><br><em>Prompt:</em> {safe_text(prompt_1)}<br><br><strong>Response:</strong><br>{reply_1_safe}</div>'\n",
    "            f'<div class=\"agw-box {box2_cls}\"><strong>2️⃣ Call #2 ({call2_mode} — {ms_2} ms)</strong><br><br><em>Prompt:</em> {safe_text(prompt_2)}<br><br><strong>Response:</strong><br>{reply_2_safe}</div>'\n",
    "            f'</div></div></div>'\n",
    "        )"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
