    "---\n",
    "## Area 6 — Executive AI Governance & Business Analytics (`./reports/create-reports.sh`)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Transforms raw LLM gateway telemetry into **Executive FinOps, Latency SLO, and Token Capacity Intelligence**—attributing AI token spend by model and developer, benchmarking Time-to-First-Token (TTFT) across proxies, and auditing blocked threats.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 6.1 — Provision AI Data Collectors & Deploy Custom Reports (`./reports/create-reports.sh`)\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Ensures all 10 `dc_ai_*` Apigee Data Collectors exist, executes `./reports/create-reports.sh`, and verifies the 3 custom analytics reports (`ai_token_cost_by_model_user`, `ai_model_usage_latency`, `ai_token_counts_by_model_user`) via the Apigee API.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Registers the custom dimensions and metrics Apigee uses to aggregate token costs, TTFT latency, and developer usage.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Click **Run (▶)** on cell **6.1** below.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** card listing all provisioned custom reports and a direct link to view them in Google Cloud Console.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 6.2 — Executive FinOps, Latency SLO & Governance Dashboard\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Queries the Apigee Analytics `/reports` and `/stats` APIs and renders a **4-panel Matplotlib chart suite + Executive HTML Dashboard**.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Provides leadership-ready KPIs on AI spend, unit economics, SLO compliance, and blocked security/quota events (with optional reference workload telemetry if Apigee's ~5–10 min async ingestion window is still indexing).\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Adjust `TIME_RANGE_WINDOW` or SLO/quota targets if desired, then click **Run (▶)**.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** An interactive-style HTML & 4-chart Executive Business Dashboard."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-19"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title 6.1 Deploy Apigee Custom Analytics Reports (./reports/create-reports.sh)\n",
    "REQUIRED_DATA_COLLECTORS = [\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_model\", \"STRING\", \"AI Model identifier resolved by the gateway\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_prompt_token_count\", \"INTEGER\", \"Prompt token count\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_response_token_count\", \"INTEGER\", \"Completion token count\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_total_token_count\", \"INTEGER\", \"Total token count\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_response_type\", \"STRING\", \"Response delivery mode\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_time_first_token\", \"INTEGER\", \"Time to first token in ms\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_cost_center\", \"STRING\", \"Business cost center\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_request_cost\", \"FLOAT\", \"Estimated USD prompt cost\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_response_cost\", \"FLOAT\", \"Estimated USD response cost\"),\n",
    "    (\"dc_ai_total_cost\", \"FLOAT\", \"Estimated total USD cost\"),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "TARGET_REPORT_SPECS = {\n",
    "    \"ai_token_cost_by_model_user\": {\n",
    "        \"name\": \"ai_token_cost_by_model_user\", \"displayName\": \"AI Token Cost by Model and User\",\n",
    "        \"chartType\": \"col\", \"timeUnit\": \"day\", \"dimensions\": [\"dc_ai_model\", \"developer_email\"],\n",
    "        \"metrics\": [{\"name\": m, \"function\": \"sum\"} for m in (\"dc_ai_total_cost\", \"dc_ai_request_cost\", \"dc_ai_response_cost\")],\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"ai_model_usage_latency\": {\n",
    "        \"name\": \"ai_model_usage_latency\", \"displayName\": \"AI Model Usage and Latency\",\n",
    "        \"chartType\": \"col\", \"timeUnit\": \"hour\", \"dimensions\": [\"apiproxy\", \"dc_ai_model\", \"dc_ai_response_type\"],\n",
    "        \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"dc_ai_total_token_count\", \"function\": \"sum\"}, {\"name\": \"dc_ai_time_first_token\", \"function\": \"avg\"}, {\"name\": \"message_count\", \"function\": \"sum\"}],\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"ai_token_counts_by_model_user\": {\n",
    "        \"name\": \"ai_token_counts_by_model_user\", \"displayName\": \"AI Token Counts by Model and User\",\n",
    "        \"chartType\": \"col\", \"timeUnit\": \"day\", \"dimensions\": [\"dc_ai_model\", \"developer_email\"],\n",
    "        \"metrics\": [{\"name\": m, \"function\": \"sum\"} for m in (\"dc_ai_total_token_count\", \"dc_ai_prompt_token_count\", \"dc_ai_response_token_count\")],\n",
    "    },\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "start_progress(\"Step 6.1 — Deploying Custom AI Analytics Reports\", \"Step 1/4: Verifying & creating 10 Apigee AI Data Collectors (dc_ai_*)...\")\n",
    "dc_s, dc_d = apigee_request(\"GET\", \"datacollectors\")\n",
    "existing_dcs = {i.get(\"name\", \"\").split(\"/\")[-1] for i in (dc_d.get(\"dataCollectors\", []) if dc_s == 200 else [])}\n",
    "created_dcs = sum(\n",
    "    1 for dc_n, dc_t, dc_desc in REQUIRED_DATA_COLLECTORS\n",
    "    if dc_n not in existing_dcs and apigee_request(\"POST\", \"datacollectors\", {\"name\": dc_n, \"type\": dc_t, \"description\": dc_desc})[0] in (200, 201, 409)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "update_progress(\"Step 2/4: Synchronizing './reports/create-reports.sh' from repository...\")\n",
    "sync_gateway_repo([\"reports/create-reports.sh\", \"config/reports/create-reports.sh\"])\n",
    "reports_script, alt_script = REPO_DIR / \"reports\" / \"create-reports.sh\", REPO_DIR / \"config\" / \"reports\" / \"create-reports.sh\"\n",
    "if not reports_script.is_file() and alt_script.is_file():\n",
    "    reports_script.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "    shutil.copy2(alt_script, reports_script)\n",
    "if not reports_script.is_file():\n",
    "    fail_step(\"Report Script Not Found\", f\"Missing './reports/create-reports.sh' in {REPO_DIR}.\", \"Re-run Step 0 to sync the repository.\")\n",
    "reports_script.chmod(reports_script.stat().st_mode | stat.S_IXUSR | stat.S_IXGRP | stat.S_IXOTH)\n",
    "\n",
