   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Area 7 — Resource Inventory Summary & Optional Safe Cleanup\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Value\n",
    "Provides a clear audit summary of every Apigee AI Gateway proxy, API Product, Developer App, and Custom Report provisioned during the lab—plus a safe opt-in toggle (`CONFIRM_DELETE = True`) to undeploy lab proxies cleanly when finished.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 7.1 — View Resource Inventory & Optional Cleanup\n",
    "- **What this step does:** Queries your Apigee environment for active AI Gateway proxy revisions, lists provisioned governance artifacts, and—only if `CONFIRM_DELETE` is set to `True`—undeploys the lab proxies.\n",
    "- **Why it is necessary:** Prevents accidental resource drift while keeping cleanup safe and explicit.\n",
    "- **What you need to do (Inputs):** Keep `CONFIRM_DELETE = False` to inspect your inventory, or set `CONFIRM_DELETE = True` and click **Run (▶)** to undeploy lab proxies.\n",
    "- **What you will get (Outputs):** A green **✅ PASS** Inventory & Cleanup Summary Card."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cell-22"
   },
   "source": [
    "#@title Area 7 — Summary + Optional Cleanup\n",
    "CONFIRM_DELETE = False  #@param {type:\"boolean\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "LAB_PROXIES = [\n",
    "    \"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth\",\n",
    "    \"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-model-armor\",\n",
    "    \"llm-gateway-completions-no-auth-ma-sdp\",\n",
    "    \"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp\",\n",
    "    \"llm-gateway-completions-auth-ma-sdp-semantic\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "start_progress(\n",
    "    \"Area 7 — Resource Inventory & Optional Cleanup\",\n",
    "    \"Undeploying lab proxies...\" if CONFIRM_DELETE else \"Auditing deployed Apigee proxies & custom reports...\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "cleanup_actions = [undeploy_proxy(px) for px in LAB_PROXIES] if CONFIRM_DELETE else []\n",
    "if CONFIRM_DELETE:\n",
    "    GATEWAY_STATE[\"active_proxy\"] = \"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "update_progress(\"Querying active environment deployments & custom analytics reports...\")\n",
    "_, env_deps = apigee_request(\"GET\", f\"environments/{APIGEE_ENVIRONMENT}/deployments\")\n",
    "active_proxies = [str(d.get(\"apiProxy\")) + \" (rev \" + str(d.get(\"revision\")) + \")\" for d in env_deps.get(\"deployments\", []) if d.get(\"apiProxy\") in LAB_PROXIES]\n",
    "_, reports_data = apigee_request(\"GET\", \"reports\")\n",
    "ai_reports = [q.get(\"displayName\", \"\") for q in reports_data.get(\"qualifier\", []) if \"AI \" in q.get(\"displayName\", \"\")]\n",
    "host_now = GATEWAY_STATE[\"host\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "show_status_card(\n",
    "    \"PASS\",\n",
    "    \"Area 7 — Apigee Unified AI Gateway Inventory & Cleanup Summary\",\n",
    "    \"Lab proxies undeployed cleanly.\" if CONFIRM_DELETE else \"Inventory audit complete (CONFIRM_DELETE=False — active deployments preserved).\",\n",
    "    rows=[\n",
    "        (\"Apigee Org / Environment\", f\"{APIGEE_ORG} / {APIGEE_ENVIRONMENT} ({host_now})\"),\n",
    "        (\"Background Service Account\", SERVICE_ACCOUNT),\n",
    "        (\"Active Lab Proxy Deployments\", \", \".join(active_proxies) if active_proxies else \"None currently deployed\"),\n",
    "        (\"API Product & Apps\", \"ai-premium-package | user_apps.yaml (key: premium-app-key-123)\"),\n",
    "        (\"Custom AI Analytics Reports\", \", \".join(ai_reports) if ai_reports else \"Run Step 6.1 to provision custom reports\"),\n",
    "        (\"Cleanup Status\", \" | \".join(cleanup_actions) if CONFIRM_DELETE else \"Dry-Run Inventory Only (set CONFIRM_DELETE=True to undeploy proxies)\"),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    ")"
   ],
